<title>RUSSIA: Russian '96 sunseed output revised to 2.8 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russian '96 sunseed output revised to 2.8 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia harvested 2.8 million tonnes of sunflower seeds in 1996, according to revised preliminary data, after 4.2 million tonnes in 1995, State Statistics Committee figures released on Sunday showed.</p>
<p>On November 28, the committee said the 1996 sunseed harvest was 2.5 million tonnes.</p>
<p>The 1991-1995 average sunflower seed harvest, for all farms, was 3.1 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
